From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Add 2 AVPs from 3GPP TS 29.336
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

3GPP TS 29.336 V19.1.0 defines these AVPs in vendor 10415, which the
dictionary has no entry for at their codes:

  Exclude-Identifiers (3188): Grouped, 2 members, clause 8.4.84
  Include-Identifiers (3189): Grouped, 2 members, clause 8.4.85

Each entry's type, enumerated values and grouped members are the
document's, from its clauses and AVP tables, and so are its M and V bits
where the document states them.

Generated by Seanchaí (integrations/wireshark/additions.py).
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..53d750c 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -8471,6 +8471,18 @@
 		<avp name="SCEF-Reference-ID-for-Deletion-Ext" code="3187" mandatory="mustnot" may-encrypt="no" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<type type-name="Unsigned64"/>
 		</avp>
+		<avp name="Exclude-Identifiers" code="3188" mandatory="mustnot" vendor-bit="must" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
+			<grouped>
+				<gavp name="External-Identifier"/>
+				<gavp name="MSISDN"/>
+			</grouped>
+		</avp>
+		<avp name="Include-Identifiers" code="3189" mandatory="mustnot" vendor-bit="must" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
+			<grouped>
+				<gavp name="External-Identifier"/>
+				<gavp name="MSISDN"/>
+			</grouped>
+		</avp>
 		<!--
 		Note: The AVP codes from 3163 to 3199 are reserved for TS 29.336
 		-->
